# Code layers

> Repository 分层（≠ 认知层）。**文档 + oxlint `freeanima/layer-deps` + tsconfig paths**。目录地图 / 包名 → [`repository-topology.mdc`](repository-topology.mdc)。

## Host 栈（高 → 低）

```
portal/cli → platform → capabilities → engine → core → kernel
```

| Layer | Directory | Responsibility |
| ----- | --------- | -------------- |
| kernel | `src/host/kernel/` | HookRegistry、logging（**方向**：加厚为 config/loop **机制**，无产品段；见 [`src-layering.md`](../../docs/product/src-layering.md)） |
| core | `src/host/core/` | PG、Redis 原语、config、tool/LLM 原语、skill |
| engine | `src/host/engine/` | conversation、turn、loop、goal、pipeline |
| capabilities | `src/host/capabilities/` | self、memory、tools、outpost、mcp-*、… |
| platform | `src/host/platform/` | 组合根；`service/` = AppRuntime |

并列：`shared`（无 React）、`ui-kit`（仅 client）、`client`、`features`、`portal`。

## Client 消环

```
app-frame → features/*/ui → { ui-kit, portal-sdk } → shared
```

- Feature UI **禁止** import app-frame / platform / engine / capabilities
- Typed Habitat client：`@freeanima/client/portal-sdk/habitat-typed-client`
- Display/snapshot：`@freeanima/shared/rpc-contract/frames/{display,snapshot}`

## Dependency matrix

| Source | Allowed | Forbidden |
| ------ | ------- | --------- |
| `host/kernel` | kernel | 其它 |
| `host/core` | kernel, core | engine+ |
| `host/engine` | kernel, core, engine | platform, capabilities |
| `host/capabilities/*` | kernel, core, own pack, shared 契约 | platform, features, other capabilities*, engine |
| `host/platform` | 全 host + features（注册） | ui-kit / client（除 habitat client 过渡 re-export） |
| `features/*/ui` | ui-kit, portal-sdk, shared；host/core 工具暂准（**禁止** `host/core/db` / drizzle） | platform, engine, capabilities, app-frame, host/core/db |
| `ui-kit` | shared util（极少） | features, host, client |
| `shared` | shared（含 `util` / `pg-shapes`；`db-shapes`/`entity-shapes` 为过渡 re-export；默认无 DOM） | host、ui-kit、client、React；DOM/`node:fs` 仅 `*-browser` / `*-node` |

**方向：** `shared` 不得依赖 host（P1 已剪）；`omitUndefined` / `randomUuid` / CST·农历工具 SSOT 在 `@freeanima/shared/util`；存储形状前端吃 `@freeanima/shared/pg-shapes`（P2 codegen 替代 `createSelectSchema`）。三分包与 portal 归属 → [`src-layering.md`](../../docs/product/src-layering.md)。

**CI**：`just qa check` → oxlint `freeanima/layer-deps` + `scripts/check-frontend-no-drizzle.ts` + `scripts/check-shared-shapes.ts`。

## Port / Catalog

Boot：`src/host/platform/boot/`；入口：`serve.ts`。禁止模块级 registry 单例。Capabilities 访问 PG：`@freeanima/host/core/db/pg/*`。
